#. ~ Description of "airsoft helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight helmet that is fashioned to look like a real military helmet, "
"but is made of plastic and only protects against BB's and other light "
"threats.  It has a military rail system for attachments."
msgstr ""
"Lekki hełm wykonany tak, by wyglądał jak prawdziwy hełm wojskowy, ale "
"zrobiony z plastiku i chroniący tylko przed kulkami airsoftowymi i innymi "
"lekkimi zagrożeniami. Ma wojskowy system szyn do mocowania akcesoriów."

